## GitHub API Sourcing

Engineers who contribute to major ML frameworks are often 6–18 months ahead of the LinkedIn market.

**Key repos to mine:**
```
pytorch/pytorch
huggingface/transformers
vllm-project/vllm
microsoft/DeepSpeed
openai/triton
google/jax
NVIDIA/Megatron-LM
```

**What to look for:**
- Contributors with 5+ merged PRs in the last year
- Authors of performance-critical commits (CUDA kernels, memory optimization, batching)
- People who open issues that get resolved — shows deep product understanding

**Quick search formula:**
```
site:github.com "[role keyword]" "commits" location:"San Francisco" OR "Seattle" OR "New York"
```

**GitHub X-Ray Boolean:**
```
site:github.com/[repo]/commits?author= "ML" OR "inference" OR "training"
```

