## IEEE & Patent Search

Patent inventors are **named and searchable** — this is how you find ASIC, SoC, and PCIe engineers who never update LinkedIn.

**USPTO Patent Search:**
1. Go to [patents.google.com](https://patents.google.com)
2. Search: `(PCIe OR CXL OR HBM OR "neural network accelerator") assignee:(company name)`
3. Click inventor names → Google them → find LinkedIn

**IEEE Xplore:**
1. Go to [ieeexplore.ieee.org](https://ieeexplore.ieee.org)
2. Search by topic + filter by affiliation (company name)
3. Author profiles often include institutional email → find on LinkedIn

**Best for:**
- ASIC / FPGA designers
- PCIe / CXL / HBM architects
- Silicon photonics engineers
- RF / mixed-signal IC designers

