## Conference Pipelines

Conference paper authors are the top 5% of their field — and most aren't actively job hunting.

**Top conferences by discipline:**

| Discipline | Conferences |
|---|---|
| ML Research | NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, CVPR, ACL |
| ML Systems | MLSys, OSDI, SOSP, EuroSys |
| Hardware / Architecture | ISCA, MICRO, HPCA, DAC |
| Networking | SIGCOMM, NSDI, IMC |

**Sourcing process:**
1. Download the proceedings PDF or browse the program page
2. Filter authors by target company affiliation
3. Find them on LinkedIn using: `"First Last" "[University/Company]" site:linkedin.com`
4. Check if they have a personal site (usually linked from the paper)

