## Outreach Templates

### Research Scientist / ML Engineer
```
Subject: [Paper title] — role at [Company]

Hi [Name],

I read your paper on [specific topic] — the approach to [specific finding] was genuinely interesting, especially in the context of [why it matters to the role].

We're building [brief description] at [Company] and have a [Role] opening that maps closely to what you've been working on. This is a [stage] company with [notable signal — funding, team, mission].

Worth a 20-minute conversation?

— Chandra
```

### ASIC / Hardware Engineer (via patent)
```
Subject: Your work on [patent topic] — [Company] hardware role

Hi [Name],

I came across your patent on [topic] while researching engineers working on [area]. The [specific aspect] caught my attention — it's directly relevant to what our hardware team is building.

We're at [stage] and hiring a [Role]. The team includes [notable signal].

Open to a quick conversation?

— Chandra
```

